menu "Deer dataset evaluation"

config DEER_EVAL_HOST_WINDOWS
    bool "QEMU host uses Windows binary file flag"
    default y
    help
        QEMU's native Xtensa SYS_open passes flags directly to the host open
        function. Windows requires O_BINARY (0x8000) for arbitrary RGB bytes.
        Turn this off on Linux/macOS hosts.

endmenu
